### Senaryo 1: Başarılı İstek (Doğru Token ve Tam Veri)
POST http://localhost:8080/webhook/ticket-created
Content-Type: application/json
X-Webhook-Token: ollechat-secret-token-123

{
  "eventType": "TICKET_CREATED",
  "ticketId": "ticket-123",
  "title": "Müşteri Destek Grubu",
  "participantIds": ["user-1", "user-2", "user-3"]
}

###

### Senaryo 2: Başarısız İstek (Yanlış Token - Güvenlik Testi)
POST http://localhost:8080/webhook/ticket-created
Content-Type: application/json
X-Webhook-Token: yanlis-token-buraya

{
  "eventType": "TICKET_CREATED",
  "ticketId": "ticket-123",
  "title": "Müşteri Destek Grubu",
  "participantIds": ["user-1", "user-2", "user-3"]
}

###

### Senaryo 3: Başarısız İstek (Eksik Veri - Validasyon Testi)
POST http://localhost:8080/webhook/ticket-created
Content-Type: application/json
X-Webhook-Token: ollechat-secret-token-123

{
  "eventType": "TICKET_CREATED",
  "ticketId": "",
  "title": "Boş veri testi",
  "participantIds": []
}